{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_109","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"planSummary\":\"Implemented Story 3 turn-construction recovery: not-ready message derivations are recovered through provider attempt or deterministic floor, fallbacks are logged with actionable reason/floor details, recovered outputs are written back as plain ready with source-version/live-work guards, and provider work remains outside DB write transactions.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added recovery receipts carrying fallback content, reason, derivation type, subject id, and source version from composition.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/derive.ts\",\"reason\":\"Wired turn construction to attempt component recovery, log floor fallbacks, persist recovered outputs, and defer persistence when live work remains.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/forms.ts\",\"reason\":\"Extended message derivation reads with source version and failure reason for recovery decisions.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/recovery.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added dedicated version-checked recovery write-back helper with live-work deferral.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added Story 3 acceptance coverage for ready use, pending/failed floors, re-derivation, provider transaction boundary, tool-result truncation floor, and live-work deferral.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/smoothing-recovery.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated prior smoothing recovery expectations for Story 3 write-back behavior.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/logging-surface.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated fallback log test to exercise Story 3 floor logging after recovery failure.\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/derivation-turns.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated turn derivation tests from gap-based behavior to log-only fallback and ready write-back beh